<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Net shr	   $0.80		    $0.73</p>
<p> Net		 121,500		  112,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs	   147,935		  150,815</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
